codex
The candidate semantics are now fixed: activation targets only occupancy-1 beams and uses each incumbent link’s actual-elevation α=.10 quantile; aggressor relief requires a below-threshold victim that would clear in noise but still would not clear after removing its largest nominal interference term; alternatives use the engine’s highest predicted cap-link SINR. The rule commits at most one candidate per anchor, in the requested family order.
