The leading path is at 51 moves and still improving. Because the algorithm may revisit a user’s assignment, convergence is not bounded by 100 moves; it is bounded by strict objective ascent over the finite legal profile space. I’m preserving that exact termination criterion and monitoring whether later steps converge faster.
